WEBVTT

00:24:28.454 --> 00:24:31.121
waiting, just waiting around
for chickens to lay eggs.

00:24:31.704 --> 00:24:33.454
And then is that real

00:24:33.996 --> 00:24:36.621
stuffy hen house for four
and a half hours?

00:24:37.829 --> 00:24:38.829
And you just sat there?

00:24:38.954 --> 00:24:42.371
Yeah, first I followed him because I
wanted to know where the hole was,

00:24:42.621 --> 00:24:45.246
where the egg came up and nobody told me.

00:24:45.704 --> 00:24:49.621
So I remember seeing this brown hen
going into one of these hen houses

00:24:49.954 --> 00:24:54.079
and crawling after her, which was a big
mistake and squawks, I presume,

00:24:54.079 --> 00:24:58.579
fear she flew out past me. I can
still feel her wing on my face.

00:24:58.621 --> 00:25:02.413
It was a bit scary and I must have
thought in that little four and